        "description": "Xiaomi Xiaoai Open Platform leverages Xiaomi's hardware ecosystem and vast data to provide globally leading voice recognition, NLP, and other artificial intelligence technologies, offering developers a one-stop artificial intelligence service platform. Xiaomi Xiaoai Open Platform includes a voice service platform and a skill development platform, creating more and better voice services and skills for enterprise-level users and individual developers.",
